  {
    "speaker": "司会",
    "text": "イメージキャラクターとして選ばれた時は\r\nどう思われましたか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011010030,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "はい\r\n私に任せていただけたこと、とても光栄に思いました",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201301101/2013011010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011010040,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私自身、\r\nコスメやメイクがとても好きですし",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301101/2013011010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "司会",
    "text": "有栖川さん、いつもお綺麗ですもんね……！\r\n何かお化粧のコツとか、こだわりとかはあるんでしょうか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011010050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "そうですね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301101/2013011010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011010060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "なりたい自分のイメージを持って……\r\n何度でも練習することでしょうか",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301101/2013011010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "司会",
    "text": "え！\r\n有栖川さんでも練習を？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011010070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ、もちろん！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301101/2013011010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011010080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "せっかく新しいものを買ったのに、\r\n自分で塗ってみたら思うようにいかなくて……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301101/2013011010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011010090,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "あれこれ試してみることもあります",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301101/2013011010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "司会",
    "text": "それは意外です……！\r\nなんでも似合っちゃいそうだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011010100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "うふふ、いいえ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301101/2013011010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011010110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "好きな色を選んで、鏡に向かって──……\r\n素敵なアイテムを、上手に使いこなせるように",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301101/2013011010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011010120,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "『すべてに、魔法をかける』なら──\r\n相応の準備をしなくちゃ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301101/2013011010120"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011010130,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "──だけど\r\n自分への魔法ならすぐにかけられるんです",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301101/2013011010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "司会",
    "text": "自分への魔法？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011010140,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "はい",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301101/2013011010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011010150,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "『こんなふうになりたい！』って\r\n理想の自分を思い描いて……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301101/2013011010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011010160,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "『このアイテムを使ってみたい！』\r\nそういう存在に出会えたら、練習はもっと楽しくなる",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301101/2013011010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011010170,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "コスメみたいにキラキラした気持ちを持つことが\r\n何より一番の魔法だと思います",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301101/2013011010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011010180,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "──このコスメが、ひとりでも多くの方の\r\n魔法のアイテムになれれば嬉しいです",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301101/2013011010180"
  },
